# Scope guard

- Build only what AGENTS.md and specs/ approve. If a ticket seems to need more, stop and say so in the pull request instead of building it.
- Never add lyric timing: no timestamp, start/end, cue, offset, active-line, or word/mora timing fields, UI, or tables.
- Only three screens (Song Library, Import Song in development only, Learn Song) and only the API routes listed in AGENTS.md.
- No accounts, learner writes, analytics, provider/catalog APIs, autoplay, looping, or line seek.
- Never edit AGENTS.md or anything under specs/. Those are Victor's plan documents.
- Never add inactive fields or UI "for later".
- If you add a folder, route, setting, or data field, update docs/codebase.md in the same change.
